2","text":"これなあ、フルリセットしてないことは問題だけど\n端末バラす前提だと、わりといろいろアリになるデバイスあるからなあ...","ts":"1625811594.400100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ClSV3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4eafff28-4bb9-49fd-ac85-fb543c937b57","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"前にセールされたときにecho dot買ったけど全然使ってない…","ts":"1625811580.399900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lhb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"000a02d7-a1f8-4c96-8dc6-c9d3ecdfb339","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1337087.html\u003e","ts":"1625811481.398600","attachments":[{"fallback":"PC Watch: Amazon Echoの処分には細心の注意を。研究者が警鐘","id":1,"title":"Amazon Echoの処分には細心の注意を。研究者が警鐘","title_link":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1337087.html","text":"　Amazon Echoといったスマートスピーカーの内部には、Wi-Fiアクセスポイントや個人情報などが保存されているため、処分や破棄時には細心の注意を要したほうがいいと、ノースイースタン大学の研究者の論文で明らかとなった。","image_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/img/pcw/list/1337/087/1.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1625804502,"service_name":"PC Watch","service_icon":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1337087.html","original_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1337087.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a0b/"}]}]
